        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for the quick reply!\n\nI've just tested and you are right about this being reproducible with `nvim --clean`, so I agree this is not a bug in 'mini.animate'. In fact, I can also reproduce this in vim 9.1. Not sure if this should be an nvim or a vim bug report, but either way that's outside the scope of mini.nvim. Apologies for the false report.",
